<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Tuntex 9-mth loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Tuntex 9-mth loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				9,358 vs 11,026</p>
<p>    Pretax			     loss 281 vs profit 2,311</p>
<p>NOTE - Tuntex Distinct Corp is one of Taiwan's leading chemical fibre and construction firms. The firm has set a 1996 pretax profit target of T$1.55 billion on sales of T$20.6 billion, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
